      "content": "Medium width (600-1023), iPad portrait 820 x 1180. Touch, so each paragraph shows a muted ⋯ in its margin. The paragraph menu opens as a popover under its ⋯; a tap outside closes it. Contents opens the outline as a drawer from the left over a scrim."
    },
