    {
      "type": "note",
      "id": "txeOD",
      "x": -480,
      "y": 7800,
      "name": "Pine & Apricot note",
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "content": "Pine & Lichen: an alternative palette on a second theme axis, palette = ink-saffron | pine-lichen. These frames are instances of the Ink & Saffron screens with theme { palette: pine-lichen, mode: light | dark } — edit the light screen only; only colors differ.\n\nExisting frames resolve to ink-saffron by default."
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "fm1bzR",
      "x": 4400,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Round 2",
      "fill": "$sunken",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 96,
      "padding": 96,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "otZk7I",
          "name": "Header",
          "width": 1100,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": "$space-lg",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "c6HhBK",
              "name": "Title",
              "fill": "$ink",
              "content": "Round 2",
              "fontFamily": "$font-serif",
              "fontSize": "$text-display",
              "fontWeight": "600",
              "letterSpacing": -0.5
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bzBJVi",
              "name": "Subtitle",
              "fill": "$ink-2",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Layout and consistency, drawn from the real program of 2026-11-05 (web-page-brief.md). The look is round 1's.",
              "lineHeight": 1.4,
              "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
              "fontSize": "$text-lead",
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "Y6qEdX",
              "name": "Decisions",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": "$space-sm",
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "HshwnY",
                  "name": "Decision",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· Topics sort by the number in the title: Модуль 1 is a group header, then Тема 1 to 9. No index of our own.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": "$text-md",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vR3XLi",
                  "name": "Decision",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· Every list row is one line: icon, short label (Тема 7), name cut with an ellipsis, a dim count or status. Full title in a tooltip on hover.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": "$text-md",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "IjI7k7",
                  "name": "Decision",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· A topic with a material carries a Read link under its row. An empty topic is one dim row with no button.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": "$text-md",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "M2qHWk",
                  "name": "Decision",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· The Тема 3 lecture is also linked from Модуль 1. It lives under Тема 3 only, and is shown as the topic itself.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": "$text-md",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "ehcXrv",
                  "name": "Decision",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· Concepts are a count (\"37 понятий\") in lists; they open on the topic page.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": "$text-md",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "WUS887",
                  "name": "Decision",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· No paragraph numbers. The ⋯ sits in the right margin on phone and desktop, and never moves: hidden at rest (mouse), shown on hover, filled when active.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": "$text-md",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "QkbpSh",
                  "name": "Decision",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· Продолжить чтение scrolls with the page. Nothing fixed covers reading text; the phone pager has its own reserved bar.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": "$text-md",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "Ua6hY6",
                  "name": "Decision",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· Desktop answers open inline under the paragraph; phone answers open as a full-width sheet with a one-line header.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": "$text-md",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vP3dR5",
                  "name": "Decision",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· Desktop sidebar is toggled by Содержание. With it open, the breadcrumb is empty, so titles are not printed twice.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": "$text-md",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "4Bj8bv",
                  "name": "Decision",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· Truncated names are drawn pre-cut with \"…\" and clipped; in code use text-overflow: ellipsis with the full title in a tooltip.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": "$text-md",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "lKMGAT",
                  "name": "Decision",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "· Frames whose names say \"stand-in\" hold invented text: the numbered list, the 1,200-character answer, five of the six concepts, and the smoke program count.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.5,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
                  "fontSize": "$text-md",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "dMNlcE",
          "name": "Components · Round 2",
          "width": 900,
          "fill": "$paper",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": "$space-xl",
          "padding": 48,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "if5bsx",
